+                   function result.  Rust source cannot subsequently read or
+                   update that compiler-only local.  Charon sometimes places
+                   the enclosing loop [Break] outside the innermost branch,
+                   leaving only storage clean-up after the assignment here.
+                   Reify the implicit return before lowering nested returns. *)
+                assign :: cleanup @ [ { assign with kind = Return } ]
